    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>List presents repeated information in a compact vertical format. It supports ListView scenarios such as grouping, selection indicators, empty state, filtering, ordering, and pagination, plus simple ListBox usage.</source>
        <target state="translated">List 用緊湊的縱向結構呈現重複信息。它支持 ListView 的分組、選擇指示器、空狀態、篩選、排序和分頁，也覆蓋簡單的 ListBox 用法。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Display a collection of related items with selection, grouping, sorting, filtering, and paging.</source>
        <target state="translated">展示一組相關項目，並支持選擇、分組、排序、篩選和分頁。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
